MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a7f4a33f894b2b440a0c98d90dc2de4f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Shotgun_JohnBrowning
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  specialistName: John Browning
  callFee: 45
  startNodeID: start
  nodes:
  - nodeID: start
    speaker: 0
    text: Got a shotgun here, guy's asking $700.
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: greet
    choices: []
  - nodeID: greet
    speaker: 1
    text: Alright, tell me what stands out on it.
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: hub
    speaker: 0
    text: 
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: 
    choices:
    - choiceText: There's an engraved stamp on the receiver.
      nextNodeID: engrave_info
    - choiceText: It's got a double trigger.
      nextNodeID: double_trigger_info
    - choiceText: Handle's black.
      nextNodeID: black_handle_info
    - choiceText: There's a vent rib on top of the barrel.
      nextNodeID: vent_rib_info
    - choiceText: No, that's all.
      nextNodeID: end
  - nodeID: engrave_info
    speaker: 1
    text: If that engraving's legit, the stock should be wood. Serial number should
      fall between 150 and 500.
    inspectionHintID: shotgun_engraved_receiver
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: double_trigger_info
    speaker: 1
    text: Then the barrel should be side-by-side, not stacked. Serial number should
      start with a 2.
    inspectionHintID: shotgun_double_trigger
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: black_handle_info
    speaker: 1
    text: If it's genuinely black, manufacture year should be before 1960. Serial
      number shouldn't contain a 5 anywhere.
    inspectionHintID: shotgun_black_handle
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: vent_rib_info
    speaker: 1
    text: Stock should be green on that configuration. Serial number needs to be
      under 700.
    inspectionHintID: shotgun_vent_rib
    nextNodeID: hub
    choices: []
  - nodeID: end
    speaker: 1
    text: Alright, check it careful. Good luck.
    inspectionHintID: 
    nextNodeID: 
    choices: []
